 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！出门前，先看看窗外。今天的天气怎么样呢？"
    },
    {
     "en": "weather"
    },
    {
     "zh": "天气。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:weather",
    "focus:weather"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "晴天、雨天、下雪天，都是天气："
    },
    {
     "en": "weather"
    },
    {
     "zh": "中间的 e a，在这里读得很短。"
    },
    {
     "en": "How's the weather today?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:air",
    "edge:weather>air",
    "focus:air"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们每时每刻都在呼吸的，是空气："
    },
    {
     "en": "air"
    },
    {
     "en": "fresh air"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "今天要学一个小魔法：很多天气的词，就是在名词后面加上一个字母 y。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sunny",
    "edge:weather>sunny",
    "focus:sunny",
    "alt:sunny"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "太阳是"
    },
    {
     "en": "sun"
    },
    {
     "zh": "加上 y 的时候，要再多写一个 n。晴朗的："
    },
    {
     "en": "sunny"
    },
    {
     "en": "It's sunny today."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sunshine",
    "edge:sunny>sunshine",
    "focus:sunshine"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "太阳照下来的光，暖暖的，是阳光。太阳，加上照耀："
    },
    {
     "en": "sun"
    },
    {
     "en": "shine"
    },
    {
     "en": "sunshine"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:cloudy",
    "edge:weather>cloudy",
    "focus:cloudy",
    "alt:cloudy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "云是"
    },
    {
     "en": "cloud"
    },
    {
     "zh": "满天都是云，就是多云的："
    },
    {
     "en": "cloudy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:windy",
    "edge:cloudy>windy",
    "focus:windy",
    "alt:windy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "风是"
    },
    {
     "en": "wind"
    },
    {
     "zh": "树叶被吹得哗哗响，就是刮风的："
    },
    {
     "en": "windy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:rainy",
    "edge:weather>rainy",
    "focus:rainy",
    "alt:rainy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "雨是"
    },
    {
     "en": "rain"
    },
    {
     "zh": "下雨的："
    },
    {
     "en": "rainy"
    },
    {
     "en": "It's rainy. Take an umbrella."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:shower",
    "edge:rainy>shower",
    "focus:shower"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "雨下一会儿就停了，这种一阵一阵的雨，叫阵雨："
    },
    {
     "en": "shower"
    },
    {
     "zh": "洗澡用的淋浴，也是这个词哦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:storm",
    "edge:rainy>storm",
    "focus:storm"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "雨越下越大，还打雷闪电，那是暴风雨："
    },
    {
     "en": "storm"
    },
    {
     "zh": "同样，加上 y，就是有暴风雨的：",
     "cue": [
      "alt:storm"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "stormy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:foggy",
    "edge:air>foggy",
    "focus:foggy",
    "alt:foggy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "雾是"
    },
    {
     "en": "fog"
    },
    {
     "zh": "加上 y 的时候，要再多写一个 g。有雾的："
    },
    {
     "en": "foggy"
    },
    {
     "zh": "雾天里，什么都看不清。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:hot",
    "edge:sunny>hot",
    "focus:hot"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "夏天，太阳火辣辣的，好热："
    },
    {
     "en": "hot"
    },
    {
     "en": "It's so hot!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:cold",
    "edge:hot>cold",
    "focus:cold"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "热的反面，是冷："
    },
    {
     "en": "cold"
    },
    {
     "en": "It's cold. Put on your coat."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:snowy",
    "edge:cold>snowy",
    "focus:snowy",
    "alt:snowy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "冷到一定程度，就会下雪。雪是"
    },
    {
     "en": "snow"
    },
    {
     "zh": "下雪的："
    },
    {
     "en": "snowy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:sunny,cloudy,windy,rainy,snowy,foggy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们把名词和它的 y 形式，一对一对地读一遍："
    },
    {
     "en": "sun, sunny",
     "cue": [
      "focus:sunny"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "cloud, cloudy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:cloudy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "wind, windy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:windy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "rain, rainy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:rainy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "snow, snowy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:snowy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "fog, foggy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:foggy"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们来当小小天气预报员吧！"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "Good morning! Here's the weather.",
     "cue": [
